            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mur’ ico gihe Abisirayeli nta mwami bāribgagire. Kand’ ico gihe umuryango w’Abadani warik’ urironderera ishamvu yo kubamwo, kuko kugeza ico gihe ata shamvu bāribgaronke mu miryango yindi y’Abisirayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.13.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Guh 13:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.2.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 2:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw Abadani batora mu muryango wabo wose abantu batanu barīndūka, bava i Sora n’i Eshitayoli, babatuma kuja gutata igihugu no kugisuzuma; barababarira, bati Ni mugende musuzume ico gihugu uko kimeze. Nuko baragenda, bīhēreza umugamba w’Abefurayimu, bashika ku rugo rwa Mika, ngw abe ari ho barāra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bacegereje kwa Mika, bamenya ijwi rya wa musore w’Umulewi, bakeberezayo, baramubaza, bati Ni nde yakuzanye ino? Ukora iki hano, kand’ uhatungiwe n’iki? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.17.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Abac 17:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abadōndera uko Mika amutunze kwose, at’ Arampemba, nanje nd’ umuherezi wiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.27.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Guh 27:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.20.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Abac 20:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.14.37"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 14:37",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.22.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "22:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baramubarira, bat’ Enda se tubarize Imana, tumenye ko tuzogira amahirwe mu rugendo rwacu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.1.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 1:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo muherezi arabishura, ati Ni mugende uburarame: Uhoraho arabaragira mu rugendo rwanyu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.18.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
