            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ Abadani bīshingira ca gishushanyo kibājwe; kandi Yonatani mwene Gerushomu, Gerushomu wa Mose, ni we yabaye umuherezi w’umuryango w’Abadani, bo n’uruvyaro rwiwe, gushitsa igihe abo mu gihugu bajanywe kw inyagano. ",
          "type": "text",
